&_nc_oc=AdrT2fK1UxRui-FU9DB8KUSStl1CNVumHvbzIJakY5mdtg7KX3Vc4wSr_HexbuzpqDw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBAKyKisoQf4f-HpGgrqwQqf8N49p1hWAh1T9XJO0DsFg&oe=6A510CBE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RgBgutjcjqYQ7kNvwHF4w94&_nc_oc=AdpDCRYWe6EJOQ32NR1kP-E4tUra_SWLMAO3t7lGfsZ_wrd4FK6dS5Gg19l9ZFqRsMk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCIoY7MxdAsgBwEwYwBJ3gf7paaQLAEvmwTFC9SQirgeQ&oe=6A50E57C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S1k0knvBbzQQ7kNvwF2oLjU&_nc_oc=AdoMzGkSmpK11z249Ssq2cr74lBIkcZJ7n6kRoxGs7C-OiTitg6xy32a0C2U_a0d89A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBep7kZ8s3FI-134R2R9PDfo-hJK874JiNovsDIwZGr5A&oe=6A510407"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hoyQeGr0FaQQ7kNvwFS6Ft_&_nc_oc=Ado1ngZmOoWsgzrrlDlPU1Sw9B1KutGn6-l77-Gfq4f9UJg8bQjcFguIdbA1orzWKbQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBmIKqv3WjbJi7dHAEXBXmVACOEe7yjhf5I9IUAMsjyXQ&oe=6A50EFD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q-nIyuwGmeoQ7kNvwF89Lq-&_nc_oc=Adre7ur8GO19NGRFOMlAMYyZrHCToKVzw5mEfGnS_yzYaLqVtknE169OH1ikRIF6LBA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAmXWG6QenE716_dRo6Ma1XyeXCvvT70z4KA_gr5mDc6g&oe=6A50FC64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.